WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.840
No! I'm the one who should apologize!

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.900
I'll be fine, so please run away.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.950
Thank you, Sakuyo.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.320
Saki...

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.740
This feeling...

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.180
Hey, titty girl!

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.600
Can you do it, too?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.040
Then shout out loud!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.920
Declare your Love Power!

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.180
I...

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.140
Heungh?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.850
I...

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.420
I love Saki!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.680
<i>To recap the previous episode:</i>

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.200
<i>My best friend also transformed into a man.</i>

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.770
I love Saki!

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:39.160
Wait... you mean like...

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:42.770
you transformed with the 
power of blazing friendship?

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:48.580
Or is it more of a "love at first sight with 
my transformed (male) form" thing?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.510
What exactly is this?

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.890
I love Saki! In a sexual way!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.460
<i>Well... no ambiguity there.</i>

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.750
Um, could I just ask... how long 
has this been the case?

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.510
<i>It happened when we were very young...</i>

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.220
Oh, she's going right to the flashback...

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:21.800
I don't really like carrots, but I like 
them better than cellophane tape.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.880
<b>Magical Girl - Another</b>

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.980
Wow! Wow!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:20.660
<i>My brother had always been 
very good at singing.</i>

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:31.890
I don't really like carrots, but I like 
them better than cellophane tape.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.490
Hearing Mohiro-chan's singing 
is the best part of my day!

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:34.520
I like them better!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.390
Your lyrics are weird!

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.040
<i>It started with a sort of childish jealousy.</i>

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:54.410
If we walk down the path hand-in-hand...

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:49.870
<i>That led me to start
 practicing singing in secret.</i>

00:03:54.410 --> 00:04:03.430
We all become pretty birds.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:12.790
As we sing our songs, our shoes ring out.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:20.670
They ring out in the sunny sky above.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.840
<i>But you found me right away.</i>

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.420
What are you doing?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:30.410
Can I practice with you?

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:46.770
Pick some flowers and 
put them on our heads...

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:55.510
and we all become cute bunnies.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.640
<i>I had so much fun singing with you...</i>

00:04:55.800 --> 00:05:04.820
As we sing and dance, our shoes ring out.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.180
<i>that at some point, that became my goal.</i>

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:13.740
They ring out in the sunny sky above.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.140
See you!

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.540
Bye-bye!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:25.680
<i>That day, you went home 
early to do something else.</i>

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.350
<b>Pedestrian Tunnel</b>

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:33.300
<i>But...</i>

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.600
Saki! Hurry!

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.870
Wait up!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.030
I found a place where our 
voices will really carry!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:50.610
<b>Pedestrian Tunnel</b>

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.150
Wow! So cool!

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.150
Right?

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:17.230
The sky turns dark as the sun goes down...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:27.620
The bell at the mountain temple rings!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:38.190
Let's all go home, hand-in-hand.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:48.770
Let's go home with the crows!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:42.410
Let's hurry!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.340
Yeah!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.420
Saki! Be careful, okay?

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:59.140
Sakuyo!

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.530
I'm sorry.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.900
I'm sorry... Saki...

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.240
H-Hey, it's okay.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.470
I'm sorry.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.970
It's okay! Someone will pass by soon, I bet.

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.760
<i>That's when I had a thought...</i>

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:41.050
<i>I wished that that moment
could last forever.</i>

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.050
It's cold...

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.450
<i>God, please...</i>

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.610
<i>I don't care what happens to me.</i>

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.130
<i>Just let Saki get home safely, please.</i>

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.800
<i>Please, God!</i>

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.930
It's okay. Don't worry!

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.130
Mohiro-chan!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.120
<i>I don't know how he knew we were there,</i>

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.870
<i>but it was my brother who came to save us.</i>

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.910
Are you sure?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.740
I don't know the way back.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:50.180
On the beach on a blue moonlit night...

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.230
A song?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:10:04.780
Crying birds, searching for their parents...

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:18.390
Are born from the land of the waves...

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.500
This way, woof!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.500
Hop, hop!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.750
This way, squirrel!

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.910
Wow!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:32.390
Their damp wings shine 
the color of silver...

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.400
<i>I admired my brother so much.</i>

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:45.610
The sadness of the birds 
who sing at night...

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.180
I'm not too heavy, am I?

00:10:47.320 --> 00:11:00.270
Crossing the sea, searching 
for their parents...

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:14.330
Disappearing in the country 
of the moonlit night...

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:28.020
The silver-winged birds of the shore.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.330
<i>I admired him.</i>

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.580
<i>I really did.</i>

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.660
Wow!

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.860
I feel so much better.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.380
Thank you, Mohiro-chan...

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.890
Mohiro-chan? Mohiro-chan?!

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:54.970
<i>It wasn't that he 
knew where we were.</i>

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:59.960
<i>He'd spent hours searching,
 until he had finally found us.</i>

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.360
Looks like he aggravated his cold.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.460
He also seems to be exhausted.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.010
We should let him rest for a while.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:30.000
I'm sorry, Mohiro-chan.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:35.050
I'll work really hard...

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.920
so you never have to suffer again.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:43.770
I'll work hard, too.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:51.280
This was all my fault, for not 
looking where I was going!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.560
You two didn't do anything wrong.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:58.180
So... I'll protect Nii-san.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.170
I'll protect you, too, Saki.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.550
I'm r-really sorry, you guys...

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.240
Let's wait until Mohiro-chan's better 
so he can be mad at both of us together.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.040
Okay?

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.500
Okay.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:17.290
I promise... I'll protect you!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:22.180
<b>The End</b>

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.200
Thus concludes "Sakuya's 
Thrilling First Love."

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:27.700
<b>The End</b>

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.690
Oh, I see!

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.690
Seriously, your face is a mess!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:34.130
I'm sorry for being dishonest in the past.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:39.690
But I really do want to 
protect you, and I love you.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.790
U-Um...

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:47.900
I want both you and my 
brother to be happy...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.300
So I promised myself I'd take these
 feelings with me to the grave.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:57.180
But transforming seems to have 
shaken off all my doubts...

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:01.350
I feel like even though you love 
my brother, I could still...

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:03.260
make you mine!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.310
<i>So manly!</i>

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.210
I now know... this is who I really am.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.360
It's who I was born to be.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:15.030
From the moment I was born, you were my sun,

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.270
and I was your Pluto, 
orbiting you from afar...

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.900
Now, I know Pluto 
may no longer be a planet,

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.600
but that's not relevant here.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:25.110
<i>She's thrown caution to the wind</i>

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:27.530
All else aside, Saki, I would 
give anything for you...

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.480
<i>to rattle off lines like a prince 
in a harlequin romance...</i>

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:32.580
Stray Dog Aura

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:30.580
Sorry. Am I making you uncomfortable?

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:37.620
<i>But she looks so much like Mohiro-chan, 
it's making my heart skip a beat...</i>

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.490
<i>I'm in a total "God of Conquests" situation!</i>

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.080
Okay, let's take a minute 
to calm down. Okay?

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:45.650
Look out!

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.320
I'm in a total "God of Conquests" situation!

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.920
Okay, let's take a minute 
to calm down. Okay?

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.520
Look out!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.800
Out of the way.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.920
<i>She's so strong... She attacks
without a trace of mercy.</i>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.730
That's one handsome woman!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:47.740
Sakuyo seems pretty up to the challenge... 
Are you sure you really need me?

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.190
No, I think we do.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:54.380
I don't think I can use my full 
power unless you're in danger.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:58.210
Without you here, I'd probably 
lose a fight to a praying mantis.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:02.360
<i>Her abilities really
get to the point, too.</i>

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.040
Well, Mohiro's safe now, right?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.590
So it's all good.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.680
True, but still...

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:10.730
<i>She's ignoring me...</i>

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.870
<i>But seriously, what the hell is Hyoe doing?</i>

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.370
In the bathroom, maybe?

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.500
That bastard!

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.540
<i>Sorry! The bathroom was, 
like, totally crowded!</i>

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.950
He was really in the bathroom?! 
Took him long enough!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:26.130
Well, I think that should do it.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:31.750
Time to "Max Heart" it up
 as a magical girl duo!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.790
You get my drift, right?

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:35.170
Well, we're done here!

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:37.550
Dismissed!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:42.630
Dammit! We've got plot threads dangling here,

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.360
and he's just disappearing 
like everything's wrapped up!

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:50.550
There's somethin' fishy about Mohiro...

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:53.230
What do you mean by that?

00:16:55.400 --> 00:17:00.670
<i>At any rate... there's a good chance that 
the demons might target Mohiro-chan again.</i>

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:06.750
<i>And... I feel like I have a target 
on my back right now, too.</i>

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.910
<i>That's right! The vibe between 
us has gotten out of control!</i>

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.250
<i>What do we do now?!</i>

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.810
<i>And... she's getting closer and closer...</i>

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:17.310
<i>You've shed all your inhibitions,
 haven't you, my friend?</i>

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.520
Well, we'd better get going—

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:20.720
<i>I-I'm gonna get pounded!</i>

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.890
<i>Is this that "Boys Love" thing 
I've heard so much about?</i>

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.810
<i>Wait, what would this be called?</i>

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.700
As long as you're Saki,

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.700
I don't care if you're a man, 
a dog, or even an amoeba.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.070
<i>I'm totally not a dog or an amoeba!</i>

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:44.160
<i>And what's with this huge puddle of sweat?</i>

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:48.190
<i>This is just way too much, though.</i>

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.960
<i>What am I, a camel's hump?</i>

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.460
What...

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:54.500
It's me!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.010
<i>And suddenly, the manager appears?!</i>

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.290
I mean... what are you doing here?

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:02.240
You know! Wherever there's a magical 
girls, that's where you'll find me!

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.800
Okay! Okay, okay!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.770
<i>I have no idea how to react to that line...</i>

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.760
You were so awesome today!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.730
Oh, sorry to get in the way 
of you two young people...

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:17.250
But I never expected Sakuyo-chan 
would transform, too!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:21.190
I can't express how lucky I am 
to be a magical girl manager!

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.270
I can't hold in my excitement!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.780
<i>Seeing him this worked up right after 
a battle is pretty annoying...</i>

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:26.530
And now I have a great idea!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.980
Why don't you both be magical girl idols?

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.300
Well? Well? Well? Well?!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.300
Wh-Whoa, what are you talking about?!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.630
Don't worry!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.020
I just know it'll sell!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.850
It'd be a rocket straight to the 
big top! We could make it happen!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.550
I'll upload the video I took
to a video upload site.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.170
Then low-life bloggers, 
intrigued by the title,

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:48.560
<b>Strange Things Aggregator</b>

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:48.560
<b>New Articles
</b>This amateur CGI is too cool!
[Content Warning] This is too crazy!
SFX Action Actor RAGES and destroys a mascot!
[Video] Saw a strange white creature under the bridge
WOW!!!!! This dude was a magical girl in his past life lololololol

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:47.840
will start spreading it 
on alternate accounts.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:54.620
Then, maybe a famous entertainer comments
 on the video and spreads it around on social media...

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.090
Why, the views alone... ho ho!

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.240
The TV offers would just roll in right away.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.620
But we wouldn't want people 
to think we're a joke.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.710
I'd better get a publicist to write 
some just slightly amusing copy.

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.460
Well, guess I'd better put 
the order in right now!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.920
<i>Please, no...</i>

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.080
Hey, can we stop him somehow?!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.580
What do you think, Sakuyo?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:16.310
As long as I am the only one allowed 
to touch Saki's pecs, I'm good.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:16.840
Okay!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:17.540
What?!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.170
<b>Some Time Later</b>

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.910
I feel like I've seen this situation before.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.240
This is so exciting!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.070
About Saki...

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.120
Well, maybe it'll work out.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:33.310
<i>"Thank goodness, my manager's
nonsense rambling saved my ass."</i>

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:37.580
<i>Saki had grown strong enough 
to think of things that way.</i>

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.650
Voices may echo here, so please refrain 
from talking loudly.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.400
It's the same...

00:19:54.040 --> 00:20:01.510
Woman

00:19:54.040 --> 00:20:01.510
Man

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.000
Let <i>pi</i> be the chest protrusions 
of a female body.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:01.840
Change

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.510
How is the mass of <i>pi</i> conserved
when one transforms into a male body?

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.490
If the protrusions equal <i>pi</i>,

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.880
then one can expect it to be converted 
to the protrusion on the lower body.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.220
Brother!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.400
You have a rival in me.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.410
<i>Of course, Sakuyo wasn't going to give up.</i>

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:32.680
<i>Mohiro failed to understand, 
but he nodded nevertheless.</i>

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:46.300
<b>Magical Girl Idol Debut?!
Who could it be?!</b>

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.410
<i>Magical Girl Idol Debut?!</i>

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.430
<i>Just who could it be?!</i>

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.300
<i>More after the commercial break!</i>

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.810
<b>Magical Girl Idol Debut?!
Who could it be?!</b>

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.440
Th-That was fast!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.810
<b>Asano Shimbun</b>

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.610
<b>Magical Girl Idol Debut</b>

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:15.990
<b>Hagimoto</b>

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:14.440
Magical girls?!

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:56.520
Mob Woman

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.410
<i>It's time for our very first...</i>

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.290
<i>TV appearance!</i>

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:22.760
<i>I am Mikage Sakuyo.</i>

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:25.000
